WEBVTT

00:05:59.463 --> 00:06:03.263
We have two beautiful girls
who are 10 and 12 years old,

00:06:03.297 --> 00:06:05.930
and they are also
member-owners of the S Group.

00:06:06.397 --> 00:06:09.730
Their memberships cost us
one hundred euros each.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.597
We want to pass on the legacy

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:16.263
and teach them about the benefits
of cooperatives early on.

00:06:16.263 --> 00:06:17.463
And of course,

00:06:17.463 --> 00:06:19.597
they are very happy
about the yearly interest

00:06:19.597 --> 00:06:20.963
on cooperative capital.

00:06:21.463 --> 00:06:24.963
But it's not just about us
getting money back.

00:06:24.997 --> 00:06:27.863
It's about the greater good
for our community.

00:06:27.897 --> 00:06:30.830
I'm not only talking
about taxes and employment,